{"title": "Scar of Fury", "pageid": 14025, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Scar_of_Fury", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Damage.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d8/Generic_Damage.webp/300px-Generic_Damage.webp, /w/images/d/d8/Generic_Damage.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d8/Generic_Damage.webp/300px-Generic_Damage.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d8/Generic_Damage.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>Scar of Fury is a passive feature that grants a creature a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a> when their health is below 40%.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Score a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a> when your health is lower than 40%. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Gandrel\" title=\"Gandrel\">Gandrel</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Pumler_Grejit\" title=\"Pumler Grejit\">Pumler Grejit</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ulma\" title=\"Ulma\">Ulma</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This effect doubles damage dice just like a normal critical hit does, but does not cause attacks to actually be classified as critical hits. Notably, this means that sources of <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_hit#Negating_critical_hits\" title=\"Critical hit\">critical hit immunity</a> do not apply against this effect.</li></ul>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715114942\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.025 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.029 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 458/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2115/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1627/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 10/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 241/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643646/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   24.089      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   24.089      1 -total\n 41.47%    9.990      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 17.27%    4.161      1 Template:PageSeo\n 16.09%    3.875      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 14.31%    3.448      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 14.15%    3.409      3 Template:IfEmpty\n  7.31%    1.762      1 Template:Passive_creatures_list\n  6.00%    1.445      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n  1.32%    0.319      1 Template:Clear\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:14025-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715114942 and revision id 386090. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}